⍝ APL2 variable (2 ⎕TF) --------------------------

∇test_2TF B;VAR;Z1;Z2;Z3
 ⍝⍝ test 2 ⎕TF

 ⍝ assign value B to variables VAR
 VAR←B

 ⍝ compute 2 ⎕TF
 Z1←2 ⎕TF 'VAR'

 ⊣ ⎕EX 'VAR'

 ⍝ compute inverse 2 ⎕TF of Z1
 Z2←2 ⎕TF Z1

 ⍝ check that VAR was restored properly
 Z3←VAR≡B

 ⍝ display results
 '≡:   ' Z3 (↑Z3↓'(*** DIFFERENT***' '(SAME)')
 'VAR:' (4 ⎕CR VAR)
 '2⎕TF:' Z1
